She looks like a giant chihuahua.

00:05:32.170 --> 00:05:33.050
Hey, what's up?

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:37.520
Hey, so Caitlin turns 15 this weekend and I'm putting together an album for her.

00:05:37.660 --> 00:05:38.500
That's nice of you.

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:43.830
Yeah, well, she hasn't been home for once since she was 12, so I've got a few to make up for.

00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:47.650
Well, as long as it comes with two-carat diamond earrings, I'm sure little Caitlin will be happy.

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:51.020
My parents kind of went overboard on Caitlin's birthdays when she was little.

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:53.440
It always made Summer a little jealous.

00:05:54.150 --> 00:05:54.750
I need a coffee.

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:55.410
Anyone else?

00:06:03.740 --> 00:06:04.160
And what is it?

00:06:04.470 --> 00:06:06.010
It's just looking at these old photos.

00:06:07.060 --> 00:06:10.060
I mean, is this really the same girl who stole money from a fraternity

00:06:10.060 --> 00:06:12.250
