00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:14.590
I feel like I don't even know her anymore.

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:16.290
Families can be like that.

00:06:16.670 --> 00:06:17.490
People change on you.

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:21.210
Maybe this is your chance to get to know the new Caitlin.

00:06:21.490 --> 00:06:21.850
Yes.

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:27.340
I mean, otherwise she goes back to school and I have to go to college and that's it.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.080
to Soleil. Yeah, what's wrong with that?

00:06:32.590 --> 00:06:34.340
Most people I know just had a clown

00:06:34.340 --> 00:06:36.530
at their birthday party. My mom went

00:06:36.530 --> 00:06:38.590
all out. We had presents,

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:40.310
games, petting zoo,

00:06:40.510 --> 00:06:42.750
and honestly the best part was always the after

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:45.300
party. The whole family together.

00:06:47.020 --> 00:06:48.780
We'd stay up late and eat cake,

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:50.490
watch the sound of music,

00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:52.040
sing along.

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:57.240
Oh, you mean like 16 going

00:06:57.240 --> 00:06:59.600
on 17? Yeah, except

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:02.470
However old I was turning, we'd always put in the ages.

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:05.290
I guess as long as we still do that, the rest doesn't really matter.

00:07:07.980 --> 00:07:10.480
