00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:20.900
Now that she's back at Harbor, I haven't even talked to her since your mom's party.

00:07:21.990 --> 00:07:23.350
I mean, since we had our midnight swim?

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:27.430
Since you had your midnight swim and I got your towel.

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:29.230
Most guys would have taken advantage of me.

00:07:32.410 --> 00:07:34.150
That's what I like about you.

00:07:35.620 --> 00:07:38.790
And let's talk about what you're gonna get me for my birthday.

00:07:57.810 --> 00:07:59.960
Really, I am so sorry.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.720
to keep you waiting a procedure right now.

