00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:11.850
Well, let's enjoy the time that we have.

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:13.530
I'm just happy that we're finally meeting.

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:15.550
After you postponed twice,

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:17.900
