00:08:18.020 --> 00:08:21.010
No, I just kept thinking about the fact that

00:08:21.010 --> 00:08:22.470
our daughters are best friends.

00:08:22.530 --> 00:08:25.440
I'm a recent widow. You were just out of a marriage.

00:08:27.170 --> 00:08:29.860
