00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:10.480
Yeah, I'm freaking out.

00:09:10.740 --> 00:09:12.980
For years, I've been talking about how much I want to get out of here.

00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:18.230
And then, as soon as it's time, I'm all like, no, no, I'm not ready.

00:09:18.510 --> 00:09:20.290
No, what you're feeling is totally natural.

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:27.240
I felt that leaving the Bronx for California, I was terrified about fitting in.

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:29.970
I spent a month practicing how to say, dude.

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:32.940
You still say it kind of, but...

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:35.320
Look, you're about to begin this great adventure,

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:37.160
and you have no idea what's going to happen.

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:39.480
Yeah, I just don't really feel like it's the beginning of anything.

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:41.540
I feel like more things are coming to an end.

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:43.770
I'm sorry. It's the hospital board.

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:47.400
Bill, how you doing?

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:51.440
I'm going to take a walk.

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:53.200
Good idea. Clear your head.

00:09:53.340 --> 00:09:54.380
I'll talk to you when you get back.

00:09:55.180 --> 00:09:55.600
I'm sorry.

